{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/programming' data-target='computer\/programming' data-title='Programming'>\r\n\t\t\tProgramming\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/programming\/javascript' data-target='computer\/programming\/javascript' data-title='JavaScript'>\r\n\t\t\tJavaScript\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Working notes on Notes: if(!!var), undefined, Null, if (typeof something === \"undefined\"), Delete Node, and Parent.","label":"Notes","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/programming\/javascript\/geo_location","label":"Geo location","url":"\/computer\/programming\/javascript\/geo_location"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/programming\/javascript\/timer","label":"Timer","url":"\/computer\/programming\/javascript\/timer"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t\t<div class='content-image-container'>\r\n\t<div class='cover-image cover-image-tile'>\r\n\t\t<img src='\/computer\/programming\/javascript\/notes.svg' alt='Working notes on Notes: if(!!var), undefined, Null, if (typeof something === \\&quot;undefined\\&quot;), Delete Node, and Parent.' style='object-fit: contain; object-position: center'>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<p class='cover-credit'>\n\t<span class='cover-credit-anchor'>\n\t\t<button type='button' class='cover-credit-toggle' aria-expanded='false' aria-label='Image credit'>\n\t\t\t<svg xmlns='http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg' viewBox='0 0 16 16' width='14' height='14' aria-hidden='true' focusable='false'>\n\t\t\t\t<circle cx='8' cy='8' r='6.25' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.2'\/>\n\t\t\t\t<circle cx='8' cy='5.2' r='0.85' fill='currentColor'\/>\n\t\t\t\t<path fill='currentColor' d='M7.28 7.15h1.44v4.55H7.28z'\/>\n\t\t\t<\/svg>\n\t\t<\/button>\n\t\t<span class='cover-credit-popup'><span>Ujnotes<\/span> \u2014 <a class=\"content-link cover-credit-link\" href=\"https:\/\/creativecommons.org\/publicdomain\/zero\/1.0\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC0 1.0<\/a><\/span>\n\t<\/span>\n<\/p>\n\n\t<h2 class='center'>Working notes on Notes: if(!!var), undefined, Null, if (typeof something === \\\"undefined\\\"), Delete Node, and Parent.<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDetect Null.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>if(!!var)<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tNot Null.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tIe. also Not 0 (not effective for undefined).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>undefined<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\t=== undefined.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Null<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\t===null.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDetect Undefined Object (Prevent Exception).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>if (typeof something === \"undefined\")<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tAlert(\"something is undefined\");.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Delete Node<\/h2>\n\t<h4>Parent<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tE.parentNode.removeChild(e);.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;script type=\"text\/javascript\"&gt;presentation()&lt;\/script&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tScript content with src attribute is not executed.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tScript updated by innerHtml is not executed.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Detect<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\thttp:\/\/diveintohtml5.info\/everything.html\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<strong>Library.<\/strong> Http:\/\/modernizr.com\/.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tGet Text after substring.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tVar s = \"aijfoi aodsifj adofija afdoiajd?order_num=3216545\";.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tVar m = s.match(\/([^\\?]*)\\?order_num=(\\d*)\/);.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tVar num = m[2], rest = m[1];.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDocument.getElementById('classRight').style.display = 'none';.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<strong>Alternatively (not recommended).<\/strong> Document.getElementById(\"classRight\").setAttribute(\"style\",\"display:none;\");.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tThe function is called as soon as it is declared.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t(.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tFunction (...).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t{.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t\u2026.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t}.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t)(...);.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tAddEventListner in Chrome.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tAttachEvent in IE9.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>onclick<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tPass this as param (to not have to refer using id).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Open url and mailto<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>url - self<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>mailto - blank<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Break<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tDebugger;.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Log<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Log Console.log(&lt;message&gt;);<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCannot pass parameters to function pointer.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tVariable \u2018hoisting\u2019.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tVariable initialized with.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tIn JavaScript, an undeclared variable is assigned the value undefined at execution and is also of type undefined.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tAll undeclared variables are global variables.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tHoisting causes the variable declaration to implicitly occur at the top of current scope.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tAssignment though occurs at usual spot.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t\u2018use strict\u2019 changes hoisting behaviour.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tVariables are no longer hoisted.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/programming\/javascript\/notes\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/programming\/javascript\/notes\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/programming\/javascript\/geo_location' data-target='computer\/programming\/javascript\/geo_location' data-title='Geo location' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>Geo location<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/programming\/javascript\/timer' data-target='computer\/programming\/javascript\/timer' data-title='Timer' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Timer<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/programming\/javascript' data-target='computer\/programming\/javascript' data-title='JavaScript'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/computer\/programming\/javascript.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>JavaScript<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}